<p>On 04/1█/201█, the day after Comms Incident One, Station Tau released Patrol Base Occator-Alpha to the Occator Crater, being planted █ kilometers from the ejection chasm for the collection and investigation of SCP-XXXX. Occator-Alpha was stationed by three Foundation scientists, Dr. ██████ and Dr. ███ █████. Another task, assigned to Dr. ██████, was tasked summarizing the weekly findings of Occator-Alpha for Station Tau. However, after relatively eight months, we lost all communication with Occator-Alpha.</p>
