<p>Operation Theta is to be initiated above all directives without question. Resistance or objection to the execution of Operation Theta will be met with lethal force. Heed Operation Theta at all costs and ignore all potential for collateral damage to Station Tau or Dwarf Planet Ceres. The instructions for the execution of Operation Theta are as follows:</p>
<p>Once the “Occator Exigent'' report is received by Station Tau, Station Tau will disable all communication channels indefinitely.<br />
Station Tau is to launch all Nuclear Charges in a circular pattern in a diameter of 20 kilometers from the ejection chasm.<br />
